      `conflicted files: ${files}\n` +
      `the ticket's work is parked on branch ${branch}, checked out at ${worktreePathFor(session.cwd, marker.id)}.\n` +
      `the resolver agent attempted: ${note}\n` +
      (result.detail ? `git said: ${result.detail}\n` : "") +
      "resolve the conflict and resume this ticket; the merge is re-attempted on resume.",
  };
}
```

